{
  "about": "The 20 starter playlists for KaraoKry V2. Each is built from Deezer playlists found with `queries` whose title matches `playlistTitle`, ranked by Deezer's popularity score, then matched to English UltraStar songs on USDB. `years` keeps songs released in that range (USDB's year). `genres` keeps songs whose album Deezer files under one of those genres. `skipPlaylist` drops playlists whose title matches. `holiday` allows Christmas playlists, skipped everywhere else. `songWords` keeps only songs whose title or album matches. `noRap` drops songs whose album Deezer files under Rap/Hip Hop.",
